chore: [PHP] fix phpdoc for MapField keys

anything other than `string|int` is not a valid offset type. `bool` may be added, but it's not a true offset because it will be cast to an `int` if used:

```php
$a = [false => '1' , true => '2'];
$a[0] = '3';
$a[1] = '4';
var_dump($a);
// array(2) {
//   [0]=>
//   string(1) "3"
//   [1]=>
//   string(1) "4"
// }
```
